        "original_id": "cf563041-19c4-5850-800f-0344d11a8503",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Akhilendra Mishra, Ashutosh Gowariker\n- Works: Chandrakanta, Sarfarosh, Lagaan\n- Roles: Kroor Singh, Mirchi Seth\n- Topics: Indian film and television\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1990s, Akhilendra Mishra became best known for playing Kroor Singh in the Doordarshan fantasy television series \"Chandrakanta.\"\n- In 1999, Akhilendra Mishra played Mirchi Seth in the critically acclaimed film \"Sarfarosh.\"\n- In 2001, \"Lagaan,\" also called \"Lagaan: Once Upon a Time in India,\" was released as an Indian epic sports-drama film.\n- Ashutosh Gowariker wrote and directed the 2001 film \"Lagaan.\"\n- Akhilendra Mishra is an Indian film and television character actor.",
